# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# Both values come from a Firebase service-account key JSON
# (Firebase console -> Project settings -> Service accounts -> Generate new private key).
# The service account needs the "Cloud Datastore User" role.

FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL="firebase-adminsdk-xxxxx@hypr-8064c.iam.gserviceaccount.com"

# Paste the PEM exactly as it appears in the JSON, including the literal \n escapes.
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nMIIEv...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
